.TH VARMERGE 1
.SH NAME
varmerge \\- merge typed configuration values with provenance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B varmerge
varmerge [--file FILE] [--env-file FILE] [--env-prefix PREFIX] [--set NAME=value]
.br
[--schema FILE] [--strict-schema] [--format json]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Merges JSON, YAML, dotenv, environment, and explicit values under a shared typed schema.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBvarmerge --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
